       Identification Division.                                         00010000
       Program-ID. F115ICH0.                                            00020000
       Author.  Henning Langfeldt Rødland.                              00030000
      *################################################################*00040000
      *                                                                 00050000
      * FD Trade Finance                                                00060000
      *                                                                 00070000
      * Interface for all database access on table TF_Main_Charge.      00080001
      *                                                                 00090001
      * The interface kan read one spesific occurence,                  00100001
      * or several occurences, fully or partly qualified with           00110001
      * from- and to- values.                                           00120001
      *                                                                 00130001
      * When reading several occurences, one must always start with     00140001
      * -In-Get-1st, and continue with -In-Get-Next.                    00150001
      *                                                                 00160001
      * NB!  There are several key-fields, which may be used            00170001
      *      differently depending on the need.                         00180001
      *      See seperate description below.                            00190001
      *                                                                 00200001
      *                                                                 00210001
      * An ordinary Select call may look like this:                     00220001
      *                                                                 00230001
      *    Initialize                          R115ICH0-Main-Charge     00240001
      *    Set   R115ICH0-Version        To    True                     00250001
      *    Set   R115ICH0-In-Select      To    True                     00260001
      *                                                                 00270009
      * One of these:                                                   00280009
      * 1) Set   R115ICH0-In-Actual      To    True                     00290009
      * 2) Set   R115ICH0-In-Work        To    True                     00300009
      *                                                                 00310009
      *    Move  &fin-inst-id            To    R115ICH0-In-Fin-Inst-ID  00320001
      *    Move  &contract-type          To    R115ICH0-In-Contract-Type00330001
      *    Move  &contract-no            To    R115ICH0-In-Contract-No  00340001
      *                                                                 00350003
      *    Move  &currency               To    R115ICH0-In-CA-Currency  00360003
      *    Move  &part amount seq.no     To    R115ICH0-In-PA-Seq-No    00370003
      *    Move  &role type              To    R115ICH0-In-RP-Role-Type 00380003
      *                                                                 00390003
      *    Move  &charge-type            To    R115ICH0-In-Charge-Type  00400001
      *    Move  &charge seq.no          To    R115ICH0-In-CH-Seq-No    00410001
      *                                                                 00420001
      *    Call  'F115ICH0'              Using R115ICH0-Main-Charge     00430001
      *                                        R7919999-Error-Area      00440001
      *    End-Call                                                     00450001
      *                                                                 00460001
      *    Evaluate True                                                00470001
      *      When R7919999-Return-Abend                                 00480001
      *        Move  '&&&&'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       00490001
      *        Perform Z900-Abend                                       00500001
      *                                                                 00510001
      *      When R7919999-Return-Error                                 00520001
      *        ...not found...                                          00530001
      *                                                                 00540001
      *      When R7919999-Return-OK                                    00550001
      *        ...found...                                              00560001
      *                                                                 00570001
      *    End-Evaluate                                                 00580001
      *                                                                 00590001
      *################################################################*00600000
