       A000-Main                         Section.                       02620000
      *                                                                 02630000
           Perform B000-Initialize                                      02640000
      *                                                                 02650000
           Evaluate True                                                02660000
             When SW-IA-Initialize                                      02670000
               Continue                                                 02680000
      *                                                                 02690000
             When Other                                                 02700000
               Perform ZI00-Conv-Input-Version                          02710000
               Perform C000-Interface                                   02720000
               Perform ZO00-Conv-Output-Version                         02730000
      *                                                                 02740000
