      *################################################################*02780000
       B000-Initialize                   Section.                       02790000
      *                                                                 02800000
           Set   R7919999-Return-OK      To    True                     02810000
      *                                                                 02820000
           Evaluate True                                                02830000
             When L-Ext-IO-Area (1:10)   =     'INITIALIZE'             02840000
               Set   Sw-IA-Initialize    To    True                     02850000
             When Other                                                 02860000
               Move  Space               To    W-Input-Action           02870000
           End-Evaluate                                                 02880000
