               Move  'GL-VERSION-INVALID'                               03100000
                                         To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  03110000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)03120000
               Move  R115X000-Version-No To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)03130000
               Move  'VAR2'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (2)03140000
               Move  'R115X000'          To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)03150000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               03160000
               Move  'B001'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       03170000
