           End-If                                                       04820015
      *                                                                 04830015
           If  W-DB-RP-Role-Type         Not = Space                    04840003
               Set   SW-Use-Related-Party                               04850003
                                         To    True                     04860003
           End-If                                                       04870000
      *                                                                 04880000
