             When SW-Use-Fi-Asc                                         04950000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-Asc                                      04960000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CN-Asc                                      04970000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CH-Asc                                      04980000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-CN-Asc                                   04990000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-CN-RP-Asc                                05000003
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-CH-Asc                                   05010000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CN-CH-Asc                                   05020000
             or   SW-Use-Fi-CT-CN-CH-Asc                                05030000
             or   SW-Use-Everything-Asc                                 05040004
               Continue                                                 05050000
