      *################################################################.05880000
       E100-Check-Qualification          Section.                       05890000
      *                                                                 05900000
      * We use the WE-fields for comparison with the WS-fields.         05910000
      * This to verify that the qualification has not changes since     05920000
      * the Get-1st.                                                    05930000
      *                                                                 05940000
           Evaluate True                                                05950000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   05960000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         05970000
             and  WS-Cursor-OK                                          05980000
               Continue                                                 05990000
      *                                                                 06000000
             When WE-Key                 =     WS-Key                   06010000
             and  WE-Code-Sequence       =     WS-Code-Sequence         06020000
             and  WS-Cursor-End                                         06030000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    06040000
               Move  'DB-LEST-SISTE'     To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06050000
               Move  'VAR1'              To R7918030-In-Variable-Key (1)06060000
               Move  W-Table-Name        To R7918030-In-Variable-Data(1)06070000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               06080000
               Move  'E101'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06090000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06100000
      *                                                                 06110000
             When Other                                                 06120000
               Initialize                      R7918030-ErrorMessage    06130000
               Move  'GL-BRUK-GET-1ST'   To    R7918030-In-MessageCode  06140000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               06150000
               Move  'E102'              To    R7919999-Paragraph       06160000
               Perform Z900-Abend                                       06170000
