      *################################################################.06680000
       F000-Select                       Section.                       06690000
      *                                                                 06700000
           Perform F100-Prepare-Qualification                           06710000
      *                                                                 06720000
      * We will first look through the storage, to see if we have       06730000
      * already got the wanted occurence.                               06740000
      *                                                                 06750000
           Perform L200-Find-DCL                                        06760000
      *                                                                 06770000
      * If we didn't find anything, we need to read. Then we store.     06780000
      *                                                                 06790000
           If  Ind-WS                    >     W-Max-Occ-WS-Tab         06800000
           or  WS-DB2-Not-Read (Ind-WS)                                 06810000
               Perform F200-Select-Row                                  06820000
               Perform L100-Store-DCL                                   06830000
           End-If                                                       06840000
      *                                                                 06850000
      * At last we check what we've got to offer.                       06860000
      *                                                                 06870000
           Evaluate True                                                06880000
             When WS-DB2-Read (Ind-WS)                                  06890000
               Move  WS-DB2-DCL (Ind-WS) To    DCLTF-Main-Charge        06900000
               Perform J000-Get-Columns                                 06910000
