               Move  FK-TFPA-Seq-No      To WD-PA-Seq-No                07010003
               Move  TFCH-Seq-No         To WD-CH-Seq-No                07020000
               String WD-Fin-Inst-ID           Delimited by size        07030000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07040000
                      FK-TFMC-Contr-Type       Delimited by space       07050000
                      WD-Contract-No           Delimited by size        07060000
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07070000
                      FK-TFCA-Currency         Delimited by size        07080003
                      WD-PA-Seq-No             Delimited by size        07090003
                      FK-KFTY-Role-Type        Delimited by space       07100003
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07110003
                      FK-TFCT-Type             Delimited by space       07120003
                      '/'                      Delimited by size        07130000
                      WD-CH-Seq-No             Delimited by size        07140000
                                       Into R7918030-In-Variable-Data(2)07150000
               End-String                                               07160000
               Perform Z000-Error-Message                               07170000
               Set   R7919999-Return-Error                              07180000
                                         To    True                     07190000
      *                                                                 07200000
           End-Evaluate                                                 07210000
